flowchart TD
    A[Message arrives] --> B{Process OK?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Commit offset]
    B -->|No| D{Retries exhausted?}
    D -->|No| E[Retry with backoff]
    E --> B
    D -->|Yes| F[Send to DLT]
    F --> G[Alert + Investigation]

    style F fill:#ff6b6b,color:#fff
    style C fill:#2ed573,color:#fff
